            <ArticleTitle>7th nerve palsy after extradural blood patch.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>721-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a patient who developed a 7th cranial nerve palsy following an extradural blood patch; full recovery followed. The likely aetiology is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
